# (ARMOUR-X wave 2, fitcap.py) D up: 3 px reach -> 2 at T3
# (P5b2, C3d) a polearm carried at T3, the arm raised (D up: the hurt's recoil): the fist rises under the sode, so the sode
# hangs behind the arm (the neck layer, under ArmNear), the same pixels; before the T3 view (the first `replace` wins)
